&lt;p class=&quot;ql-direction-ltr ql-long-10000202573&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;ql-author-10000202573 ql-size-12 ql-font-arial&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
