&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-author-10000003316 ql-size-12 ql-font-arial&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-author-10000202573 ql-size-12 ql-font-arial&quot;&gt;xperience in autonomous systems, robotics, or automotive software development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
