&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrated history of building developer productivity tools, developing quantitative software evaluation metrics, and driving root-cause analysis in complex robotic environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
